"<p><em>Technical note:</em><br />"
"The conversation between you and this person will be sent directly.  This means it is independent from the server - so if the server connection fails, or use disconnect, your DCC Chat will be unaffected.  It also means that no irc server admin can view or spy on this chat.</p>"
